{
  "tema": 5966,
  "slug": "para-plazo-limite",
  "titulo": "Para for a deadline (by…)",
  "subtitulo": "Necesito el reporte para el lunes.",
  "foto": "t01.jpg",
  "regla": "To give a deadline (by Monday, by eight o'clock), use para + a point in time, never por. ¿Para cuándo? = by when? A length of time is not a deadline: en dos semanas, por tres horas.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Para** + a point in time = _by_, _for_: the **deadline** or time limit."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "para",
            "+",
            "el lunes / mañana / las ocho / diciembre"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Ask for a deadline with **¿para cuándo?** = _by when?_"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Para entonces** = _by then_."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Por** + time is not a deadline: it means _during_ (**por la mañana**) or _for_ a length of time (**por tres horas**)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "A **length** of time (_in two weeks_) uses **en** or **dentro de**, not **para**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **para** points at a date on the calendar and says _no later than this_."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Necesito el reporte ==para el lunes==.",
              "en": "I need the report by Monday."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==Para cuándo== está listo mi carro? —==Para mañana== en la tarde.",
              "en": "When will my car be ready? —By tomorrow afternoon."
            },
            {
              "es": "La tarea es ==para el viernes==.",
              "en": "The homework is due Friday."
            },
            {
              "es": "Quiero terminar el huerto ==para la primavera==.",
              "en": "I want to finish the garden by spring."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Para las ocho== ya estaba en el agua.",
              "en": "By eight o'clock I was already in the water."
            },
            {
              "es": "Tenemos que cruzar la línea ==para las seis==.",
              "en": "We have to cross the border by six."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Para entonces== ya voy a tener la cinta morada.",
              "en": "By then I'll already have my purple belt."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
